# Redux & RTK Query

## Struktur

```
src/redux/
├── api/
│   ├── _baseQuery.ts    # baseService() — auth header, baseUrl
│   ├── auth.ts          # createApi per domain
│   └── {feature}.ts
├── layoutSlice.ts
└── store.ts
```

## Buat service baru

```tsx
import { createApi } from '@reduxjs/toolkit/dist/query/react';
import { baseService } from './_baseQuery';

export const featureService = createApi({
  reducerPath: 'featureService',
  baseQuery: baseService(),
  tagTypes: ['Feature'],
  endpoints: (build) => ({
    getFeatureList: build.query<IPaginateResponse<FeatureApi.Item[]>, BasicParams>({
      query: (params) => ({ method: 'GET', url: '/feature', params }),
      providesTags: ['Feature'],
    }),
    updateFeature: build.mutation<IResponse<FeatureApi.Item>, FeatureApi.PayloadUpdate>({
      query: ({ id, ...body }) => ({ method: 'PUT', url: `/feature/${id}`, body }),
      invalidatesTags: ['Feature'],
    }),
  }),
});

export const { useGetFeatureListQuery, useUpdateFeatureMutation } = featureService;
```

## Daftarkan di store

```tsx
// store.ts — tambah reducer + middleware
[featureService.reducerPath]: featureService.reducer,
// middleware: ...concat(featureService.middleware)
```

## Types

Namespace per domain: `FeatureApi.PayloadUpdate`, `FeatureApi.Item`. Response wrapper: `IResponse<T>`, `IPaginateResponse<T>`.

## Don't

- fetch/axios langsung di komponen
- skip loading/error state dari hook RTK Query
